# The fixes after the review of step 15: context management, in
# cineris-agent, cineris-core, cineris-tools and cineris-config.
#
# Each finding and each note the fixes settled is broken here: a summary
# request refused as too long (finding 1) and its twins, a summary on a
# budget-reasoning model (finding 2) and the budget its main requests
# send, the user's instruction file as a link (finding 3), the hash a
# command's change leaves carried (finding 4), automatic compaction off at
# an overflow (the owner's decision), and the notes.

# ------------------------------------------------------------ finding 1

[break] refused-summary-teaches-nothing
rule: A summary request the provider refuses as too long teaches the budget, as the turn's own request's refusal does.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/turn/epochs.rs
in: Session::counted
find: self.budget_for_mut(&summarized.role) .overflowed(summarized.bytes, summarized.window);
replace:
caught-by:
    cineris-agent::it summaries::a_second_refusal_ends_the_turn_and_the_next_turns_summary_is_cut
    cineris-agent::it summaries::a_summary_request_refused_as_too_long_is_cut_and_tried_again

[break] summary-refusal-teaches-a-wrong-ratio
rule: A summary refusal teaches the ratio its own request's bytes over its model's window show, so the retry fits.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/turn/epochs.rs
in: Session::counted
find: .overflowed(summarized.bytes, summarized.window);
replace: .overflowed(summarized.bytes.saturating_mul(1000), summarized.window);
caught-by:
    cineris-agent::it summaries::after_a_refusal_the_summary_request_is_held_to_half_the_limit

[break] refused-summary-not-tried-again
rule: A summary request refused as too long is answered by one more try, cut to half the limit.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/turn/epochs.rs
in: Session::compacting
find: let again = if refusal { refused < 2 } else { from_background || fast_failed };
replace: let again = from_background || fast_failed;
caught-by:
    cineris-agent::it summaries::a_summary_request_refused_as_too_long_is_cut_and_tried_again
    cineris-agent::it summaries::a_summary_the_fast_role_refused_is_asked_of_the_main_model
    cineris-agent::it summaries::a_summary_whose_response_ends_as_too_long_is_a_refusal

[break] refused-summary-retried-without-bound
rule: The retry is bounded: a second refusal in one compaction ends the turn with compaction_failed.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/turn/epochs.rs
in: Session::compacting
find: refused < 2
replace: refused < 3
caught-by:
    cineris-agent::it summaries::a_second_refusal_ends_the_turn_and_the_next_turns_summary_is_cut

[break] refused-background-summary-not-counted
rule: A background summary refused as too long is the compaction's first refusal: the summary asked for at the trigger is its one more try.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/turn/epochs.rs
in: Session::compacting
find: if refusal { refused += 1; }
replace: if refusal && !from_background { refused += 1; }
expect: survives
# Counting it or not changes only whether a third summary request may follow
# a background refusal and a refused retry; no test reaches that far, and
# the bound still holds (at most three summary requests in a compaction).

[break] fast-role-asked-again-after-refusing
rule: A summary the fast role's model refused as too long is asked of the main model for the rest of the epoch.
file: crates/cineris-agent/src/turn/epochs.rs
