    cineris-tools files::tests::what_compaction_carries_says_what_was_read_and_what_changed
    cineris-agent::it context::a_file_a_command_changed_after_a_read_is_carried_without_the_old_hash

[break] a-read-after-the-command-keeps-no-hash
rule: A tool's read after a command's change gives the file its hash again.
